Image provenance
----------------
The atmospheric plates in /public/assets/art were produced for this project with
an image generation model. Provenance and prompts are recorded in docs/ASSETS.md
and /public/assets/sources.json.

Character portraits in /public/assets/cast and game icons in
/public/assets/games are official artwork from HoYoverse / COGNOSPHERE,
Pigeon Games and Team Jade / Tencent, used nominatively on this personal,
non-commercial fan page. They are not generated art and are not relicensed
under MIT. The Delta Force portraits use official key art because no transparent
official render is published; see docs/ASSETS.md.

The 3D moon is textured with the lunar albedo map by Solar System Scope
(https://www.solarsystemscope.com/textures/), licensed under CC BY 4.0. The
attribution is displayed in the site footer.

The GitHub avatar, the Bilibili playlist cover and the MaiBot artwork are used
as provided by their owners and remain the property of those rights holders.
This fan page is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of the rights holders.

